{
  "title": "Memory Monitor POC - Datadog Integration",
  "description": "Dashboard for monitoring memory threshold alerts from the POC application",
  "widgets": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "definition": {
        "type": "timeseries",
        "requests": [
          {
            "q": "avg:app_memory_usage_percent{kube_namespace:datadog-poc} by {pod}",
            "display_type": "line",
            "style": {
              "palette": "dog_classic",
              "line_type": "solid",
              "line_width": "normal"
            }
          }
        ],
        "title": "Memory Usage Percentage by Pod",
        "show_legend": true,
        "legend_layout": "auto",
        "legend_columns": ["avg", "min", "max", "value", "sum"],
        "yaxis": {
          "min": "0",
          "max": "100"
        },
        "markers": [
          {
            "value": "y = 60",
            "display_type": "error dashed",
            "label": "Threshold (60%)"
          }
        ]
      },
      "layout": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "width": 6,
        "height": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "definition": {
        "type": "query_value",
        "requests": [
          {
            "q": "sum:memory_threshold_exceeded_total{kube_namespace:datadog-poc}.as_count()",
            "aggregator": "sum"
          }
        ],
        "title": "Total Threshold Violations",
        "precision": 0,
        "autoscale": true
      },
      "layout": {
        "x": 6,
        "y": 0,
        "width": 2,
        "height": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "definition": {
        "type": "timeseries",
        "requests": [
          {
            "q": "sum:memory_threshold_exceeded_total{kube_namespace:datadog-poc}.as_count()",
            "display_type": "bars",
            "style": {
              "palette": "warm"
            }
          }
        ],
        "title": "Memory Threshold Violations Over Time",
        "show_legend": false
      },
      "layout": {
        "x": 8,
        "y": 0,
        "width": 4,
        "height": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "definition": {
        "type": "note",
        "content": "## Memory Monitor POC Dashboard\n\nThis dashboard monitors the memory threshold violations from the POC application.\n\n### Key Metrics:\n- **Memory Usage %**: Current memory usage of pods\n- **Threshold**: 60% (shown as red dashed line)\n- **Violations**: Counter increments when threshold is exceeded\n\n### Actions:\n- Monitor the memory usage trend\n- Check for threshold violations\n- Review alerts when violations occur",
        "background_color": "blue",
        "font_size": "14",
        "text_align": "left",
        "show_tick": false,
        "tick_pos": "50%",
        "tick_edge": "left"
      },
      "layout": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3,
        "width": 4,
        "height": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "definition": {
        "type": "check_status",
        "title": "Pod Health Status",
        "check": "kubernetes.pod.ready",
        "grouping": "cluster",
        "group_by": ["pod_name"],
        "tags": ["kube_namespace:datadog-poc"]
      },
      "layout": {
        "x": 4,
        "y": 3,
        "width": 4,
        "height": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "definition": {
        "type": "toplist",
        "requests": [
          {
            "q": "top(avg:app_memory_usage_percent{kube_namespace:datadog-poc} by {pod}, 10, 'mean', 'desc')"
          }
        ],
        "title": "Top Pods by Memory Usage"
      },
      "layout": {
        "x": 8,
        "y": 3,
        "width": 4,
        "height": 2
      }
    }
  ],
  "template_variables": [
    {
      "name": "namespace",
      "default": "datadog-poc",
      "prefix": "kube_namespace"
    },
    {
      "name": "pod",
      "default": "*",
      "prefix": "pod"
    }
  ],
  "layout_type": "ordered",
  "notify_list": [],
  "reflow_type": "fixed"
}